<!--Post: 10889--><!--Time: 1110266801-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10889"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 11:26 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok, who wants to start, I guess me since I started the thread, CNN just said a few mins ago that LE will not be charging Rader with any more than these ten murders, part of some agreement, no wonder our world is so screwed up, I want him to live a horrible, life don&#39;t get me wrong, I want him to suffer for a looooonnngggg time, But now even if LE knows of more victims, they won&#39;t be telling the families or anyone else for that matter, who wants to go next?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10889-->
<!--Post: 10891--><!--Time: 1110267470-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10891"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 11:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->A plea agreement! This early, he must be yelping like a dog shiten razorblades. That&#39;s right E. I think I&#39;m going to be sick again! <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10891-->
<!--Post: 10892--><!--Time: 1110268021-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10892"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 11:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have looked all over CNN can&#39;t find it,but it turns my stomach i hope if their are more vics they at least tell the families<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10892-->
<!--Post: 10906--><!--Time: 1110290580-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10906"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Beck<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Beck<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 6:03 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I can&#39;t imagine what the terms to the plea agreement would be. For the defense to have this kind of deal, it&#39;s got to benefit the prosecution in some way. He&#39;s confessed to 10 murders, all of which happened before the death penalty was introduced to the state. The statutes of limitations ran out on all of the many additional charges he SHOULD be facing, &#40;ie breaking and entering, burglary, attempted murder, theft, etc.&#41; What on earth could they be going towards? I&#39;m wondering if there is problems in the prosecutions case and they needed this agreement to make the case against Dennis the Menace.  <BR> <BR>Still, 10 murders, that is a lot. WHEN convicted, he&#39;s not going to be eligible for parole. Could you imagine DTDC &copy; getting out of jail when he&#39;s 80, and being chained to his house by a ankle alarm, like a... well, like a dog!!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10906-->
<!--Post: 10910--><!--Time: 1110292630-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10910"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 6:37 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Maybe they said if you tell us every detail about these 10 murders then we wont charge you for anymore than that which could have given him the death penatly. at this point only he knows who else he killed. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10910-->
<!--Post: 10998--><!--Time: 1110339360-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10998"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 7:36 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->They made a deal with Ridgeway....and were able to come up with more victims.  I know one family who&#39;s daughter was one of these.  They were in such turmoil over the decision of LE to give him life instead of death.  Once their daughters murder was admitted by GR...they were able to get a little peace.  I won&#39;t say closure, as this is something that never &#34;closes&#34;.   <BR> <BR>I feel for the families with no final answer for their loved ones.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10998-->
<!--Post: 11013--><!--Time: 1110349794-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11013"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Raidar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Raidar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 10:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->What if they did make an agreement with him and they end up finding out he murdered after the death penalty was introduced. That really wouldnt be fair.  <BR>Just My Opinion <BR>RAIDAR<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11013-->
<!--Post: 11015--><!--Time: 1110350034-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11015"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 10:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->RAIDAR?  ok...... <BR> <BR>You are right, it wouldn&#39;t be fair.  Its not fair that I have to support Ridgeway and others with my tax dollars, either. <BR> <BR>&#34; damned if you do and damned if you don&#39;t &#34;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11015-->
